# Desktop code

Follow `.cursor/skills/desktop-code/SKILL.md`.

- Prefer `main/`, `preload/`, `ipc/`, `runtime/`, `system/`, `setup/` under `src/` — not a flat dump of every file.
- Named exports; no `export *` / `import *`.
- Preload stays minimal; tests sit next to the module.
